WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.557
The mini calculator combines parameters, return values, conditions, and a safety check.

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:10.292
The operation argument determines which branch runs.

00:00:10.292 --> 00:00:15.482
Add, subtract, and multiply return direct calculations.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:20.072
Divide checks whether the second value is zero before dividing.

00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:26.855
If the operation is unknown, the function returns a clear message instead of failing silently.

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:34.296
Try divide twenty by four, divide by zero, and an operation name that does not exist.

00:00:34.296 --> 00:00:38.579
Then extend the function with exponent or modulo.
